From 9abaa10eb543314885ab04d2670d69278cd7b617 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Torbj=C3=B6rn=20SVENSSON?= <torbjorn.svensson@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:48:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] doc: arm: Correct arm_v8_1m_lob_hw effective-target name
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Update the documented effective-target name to arm_v8_1m_lob_hw
to reflect the rename in r15-9387-g5cc8a75140032b.

gcc/ChangeLog:

	* doc/sourcebuild.texi: Correct arm_v8_1_lob_ok to
	arm_v8_1m_lob_hw.

Signed-off-by: Torbjörn SVENSSON <torbjorn.svensson@foss.st.com>
(cherry picked from commit 21643ea86da0ecf37d7aaa67db873f9f877c5b82)
---
 gcc/doc/sourcebuild.texi | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gcc/doc/sourcebuild.texi b/gcc/doc/sourcebuild.texi
index f3c737126f86..e565adc9e9f1 100644
--- a/gcc/doc/sourcebuild.texi
+++ b/gcc/doc/sourcebuild.texi
@@ -2358,8 +2358,8 @@ ARM target supports the @code{-mfloat-abi=hard} option.
 @anchor{arm_mve}
 ARM target supports generating MVE instructions.
 
-@item arm_v8_1_lob_ok
-@anchor{arm_v8_1_lob_ok}
+@item arm_v8_1m_lob_hw
+@anchor{arm_v8_1m_lob_hw}
 ARM Target supports executing the Armv8.1-M Mainline Low Overhead Loop
 instructions @code{DLS} and @code{LE}.
 Some multilibs may be incompatible with these options.
